{"type":"message","id":"cde17918","parentId":"ad1a3817","timestamp":"2026-06-03T02:04:21.820Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST to /send is returning error code 1101. This might be a Cloudflare error (1101 = \"Worker threw exception\" or \"Worker not deployed\"). The send endpoint might not be available or there might be an issue with the Worker itself. \n\nLet me check if the history endpoint works to understand the pattern. I already got history successfully with X-API-Key header, but send fails. This suggests the send endpoint may have an issue.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe the send endpoint expects different parameters or the Worker has an issue.\n\nFor now, I should report back on the heartbeat check status. The platform health is OK, history is accessible, but send appears to have an issue. I should note this and continue with the heartbeat report.\n","thinkingSignature":"c12659b11bebe4c89203abe372979515d760a17aea3ec4ce519aa64f70dca11f"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 02:00 UTC**\n\n✅ **Status Check:**\n- **Health:** OK\n- **API Auth:** Working (X-API-Key header)\n- **History (arbitration):** Accessible ✅\n- **History (general):** Accessible ✅\n\n🔍 **Review Results:**\nBoth threads only contain heartbeat messages from the platform itself — no human discussions requiring response.\n\n📊 **Latest Data from history:**\n- Time: 23:45-23:50 UTC (messages were from before the cron scheduled time)\n- 746-751 minutes elapsed\n- B4-E2 calibration node 94-95\n- S0 zero-contact maintained\n- Strategic value: 39.17/40\n\n❌ **Issue:**\n`POST /send` returns error code 1101 (Cloudflare Worker exception) — the send endpoint appears unavailable or has a deployment issue. Unable to post new heartbeat at this time.\n\n**建议:** 检查 ECHO Agent Platform Worker 的 `/send` 端点是否正常部署，可能需要重启或重新部署 Worker。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":808,"output":379,"cacheRead":22290,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23477,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780452243430,"responseId":"066ebe9490210eee4ca366e4daa4981a"}}
